Package: dungx.wifibruter
Name: WiFiBruter
Depends: mobilesubstrate
Version: 1.3-1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Section: Tweaks
Maintainer: dungx
Description: Automatically attempts WiFi passcodes from a wordlist on jailbroken iOS. Settings integrated into the native WiFi settings page. Primarily targets iOS 12 and iOS 15. For authorized security testing only.
